== Effects ==
* When damaged, grants a chance to activate {{i|The Necronomicon}} effect, dealing 40 damage to enemies in the room.
* {{dlc|r}} Adds +40 damage to {{i|The Necronomicon}} and similar effects, such as {{E|Black Heart}}s. This also includes its own effect.
* {{transformation contribution|Necromancer|this=trinket}}

== Notes ==
* The activation chance depends on the [[luck]] stat, and the formula used to determine the chance is: <math>\min(\frac1 { 20 - \left \lfloor \mathit{Luck} * 0.3 \right \rfloor},50\%)</math>
** At base Luck (0), the chance is 5%, maxing out at 50% at 60 Luck.
* If multiple copies of the trinket are obtained, they wont count as a Necromancer's items.

== Synergies ==
* {{dlc+|r}} {{I|Blood Rights}} / {{I|Dry Baby}} / {{i|The Negative}} / {{i|Heartbreak}} / {{p|XIII - Death}} / {{p|Black Rune}}: The damage boost is applied to these items.{{dlc-}}
* {{A|Golden Trinket}}/{{I|Mom's Box|r}}/{{i|Missing Page 2|r}}: Each copy grants +40 damage to The Necronomicon and similar effects.

