== Trivia ==
* {{i|The Necronomicon}}, A Missing Page, and {{i|Missing Page 2}} are all references to the Necronomicon and its missing pages appearing in [[wikipedia: The Evil Dead (franchise)|Evil Dead]].
** Which, in turn, is a reference to ''[[wikipedia:The Necronomicon|The Necronomicon]]'', a fictional grimoire appearing in the works of horror writer [[wikipedia: H.P.Lovecraft|H.P. Lovecraft]].
* {{dlc|r+}} This is one of the only three trinkets that count toward a transformation, the other ones are {{t|Kid's Drawing}} and {{t|Bob's Bladder}}.

